url":"/docs/components/icon#available-slot-overrides","content":"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"},"701":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-57","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#available-slot-overrides","content":"For complete slot override patterns and examples, see the `@bento/slots` package documentation."},"702":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-58","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icons","content":"While the Icon component loads design system approved icons from the CDN by default, teams can introduce custom icons using the underlying Bento Icon system."},"703":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-59","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#adding-icons-synchronously","content":"Use the `set` method to add custom icons that are available immediately:"},"704":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-60","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#adding-icons-asynchronously","content":"Use the `ondemand` method to load custom icons from your own sources:"},"705":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-61","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icon-apis","content":"The following methods are exported from `@godaddy/antares` for custom icon management:"},"706":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-62","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icon-apis","content":"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"},"707":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-63","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icon-apis","content":"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"},"708":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-64","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icon-apis","content":"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"},"709":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-65","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#custom-icon-apis","content":"These are re-exports of the underlying Bento Icon system methods. For complete API documentation, advanced usage patterns, and implementation details, see the `@bento/icon` and `@bento/svg-parser` package documentation."},"710":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-66","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#notes","content":"Custom icons integrate seamlessly with all Icon component features (transformations, accessibility, sprite mode, etc.)"},"711":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-67","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#notes","content":"Multiple `ondemand` loaders can be registered and will be called in order until one returns content"},"712":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-68","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#notes","content":"Use the `parser` function to convert SVG strings to React elements"},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-69","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#notes","content":"Custom icons are cached automatically just like CDN icons"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-70","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#css-classes","content":"The component accepts standard `className` and `style` props:"},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-71","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#css-classes","content":"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."},"716":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-72","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"The component automatically adds data attributes for styling hooks:"},"717":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-73","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"},"718":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-74","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"},"719":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-75","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"},"720":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-76","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"},"721":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-77","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"},"722":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-78","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"},"723":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-79","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"The component also includes accessibility attributes:"},"724":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-80","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attribute