e\" label provided by React Aria."],[1404,"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."],[1401,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[1406,"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."],[373,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1403,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1405,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1402,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[700,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[699,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[707,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[708,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[706,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1583,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1156,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[688,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[222,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[692,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1409,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1547,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1581,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1189,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1311,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[1190,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[237,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[685,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[739,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[968,"**Avoid complex content**: Forms, date pickers, and multi-line content belong in a separate overlay, not in menu items."],[233,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[232,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[690,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[235,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1661,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[323,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[763,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[271,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[266,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[268,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[267,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[761,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[270,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[367,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[366,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[747,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[687,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1546,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1333,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1020,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[942,"**Composable rows**: Each `MenuItem` renders a string label or composed content (icons, checkboxes). Use render props (`isSelected`, `selectionMode`) and pass `textValue` for typeahead."],[1335,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[918,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[758,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[916,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1024,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1337,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1549,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1582,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1548,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[854,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[220,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[219,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[275,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[746,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[217,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[748,"**DOM Output:**"],[693,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1577,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[764,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[752,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements