oup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[430,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1687,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[131,"`CloseButton` dismisses an overlay: it defaults to `slot=\"close\"` and renders an `x` icon labelled \"Close\"."],[501,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[507,"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."],[508,"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."],[503,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[550,"`commitBehavior` on `DateRangePickerCalendar` applies to both presentations."],[1143,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[718,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[721,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[717,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[719,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[720,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[722,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1442,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[1372,"`default`, `full`, and `none` rounding"],[548,"`drawerProps` customizes the drawer, which defaults to `85dvh`; `popoverProps` customizes the popover."],[568,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `